title: "[Decision tree] automapper.configuration-test" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q0: "Node kind?" {shape: diamond}
q1: "Lambda with only\nAddProfile/AddProfiles/AddMaps\nof source profiles?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: new MapperConfiguration stays\n(inline-create-map, settings,\nmethod-group, package profile)"
n1: "Built here and only checked,\nCreateMapper'd or mapped with?" {shape: diamond}
n0: "Not reported: passed on\n(Find_MapperPassedOn_FindsNothing)"
f1: "Declaration, assignments, field removed\n(setup-mapper, validity-test)"
q2: "Check: receiver and arguments\nwithout side effects, a statement\n(or a test's expression body)?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: AssertConfigurationIsValid stays\n(side-effect-receiver,\nRewrite_AssertAsExpressionBody)"
q3: "Test member or lone constructor\nleft with nothing?" {shape: diamond}
f2: "Member removed\n(local-configuration, validity-test,\nclass-fixture, _Combined)"
f3: "Statements removed\n(assert-statement)"
q4: "CreateMap outside a profile\nconstructor or [AutoMap]\nin project + dependencies?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: still has maps to check\n(unmigrated-map)"
q0 -> q1: "new MapperConfiguration"
q1 -> m1: no
q1 -> n1: yes
n1 -> n0: no
n1 -> f1: yes
q0 -> q2: "AssertConfigurationIsValid"
q2 -> m2: no
q2 -> q3: yes
q3 -> f2: yes
q3 -> f3: no
f2 -> q4: "holds a check"
f3 -> q4: "holds a check"
q4 -> m3: yes
